<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ro">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Resetare parolă</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f5f7fa;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #2d3748;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e0234e 0%, #c01e44 100%);
      padding: 40px 40px 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .header .subtitle {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .content { padding: 48px 40px 40px; }
    .greeting {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1a202c;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .message {
      color: #4a5568;
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .token-container {
      background: #f7fafc;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 32px 0;
      border: 2px dashed #e2e8f0;
    }
    .token-label {
      font-size: 14px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      color: #a0aec0;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .token-code {
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1a202c;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      background: #edf2f7;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      display: inline-block;
      user-select: all;
    }
    .token-expiry {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #718096;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }
    .token-expiry span {
      color: #e0234e;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .footer {
      background: #f7fafc;
      padding: 24px 40px;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .footer p {
      color: #718096;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
  <div class="header">
    <h1>Resetare parolă</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Ai solicitat o parolă nouă</p>
  </div>
  <div class="content">
    <p class="greeting">Salut!</p>
    <p class="message">
      Am primit o cerere de resetare a parolei pentru contul tău.
      Folosește codul de mai jos pentru a seta o parolă nouă.
      Dacă nu ai cerut tu asta, poți ignora acest email.
    </p>
    <div class="token-container">
      <div class="token-label">Cod de resetare</div>
      <div class="token-code">{{token}}</div>
      <div class="token-expiry">
        Acest cod expiră în <span>{{expiresInMinutes}} minute</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
    <p>Nu partaja acest cod cu nimeni.</p>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
